// BFME 2 has no EMPUpdate or LeafletDropBehavior: retail game.dat carries no
// "EMPUpdate" or "LeafletDropBehavior" module-name string and the module
// factory does not register either, and the ledger holds no row for any of
// their methods. The Zero Hour bodies this port carried (ctors, dtors, update,
// doDisableAttack, onDie, crc, xfer, loadPostProcess) were nonmatching
// reconstructions of code retail never had, and they left the unit unable to
// link. Only Drawable::setInstanceScale (0x002C8F2E, which EMPUpdate::update
// used to emit out of line) is a retail body here. The pointer constant below
// only makes this TU emit that inline out of line; it is not retail code or
// data.
void (Drawable::*const Drawable_setInstanceScale_Address)(Real) = &Drawable::setInstanceScale;
